00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:39.680
and things. Now when signing about descriptions&nbsp;
it's extremely important to use body language&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.240
and facial expression when you're signing.&nbsp;
It may feel a little awkward but this is so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:50.080
important to show the intensity of the sign and&nbsp;
even the meaning. For example, we have the sign&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:58.400
SCARED but if we don't use any facial expression&nbsp;
it doesn't mean anything but when we put facial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:04.960
expression with it it's showing the intensity&nbsp;
of how scared you are. So you could be or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:13.040
showing the difference of SCARED or TERRIFIED.&nbsp;
So let's learn how to sign descriptions.&nbsp;

